<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-11-21T18:05:33+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:05:33 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA['No easy task': Bhagwat on 100-year journey of Akhand Deep, bats for discipline and dedication]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-easy-task-bhagwat-on-100-year-journey-of-akhand-deep-bats-for-discipline-and-dedication/articleshow/136054187.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136054187.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During the centenary celebrations of Akhand Deep, Mohan Bhagwat emphasized the importance of discipline and commitment in organizational efforts. He highlighted the ongoing challenges in earning societal trust and urged volunteers to embrace the selfless spirit of Lord Hanuman. Bhagwat conveyed his belief in the persistent significance of Sanatan Dharma in today's world, celebrating both the foundation of Akhand Deep and the birth centenary of Mata Bhagwati Devi Sharma.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-easy-task-bhagwat-on-100-year-journey-of-akhand-deep-bats-for-discipline-and-dedication/articleshow/136054187.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-easy-task-bhagwat-on-100-year-journey-of-akhand-deep-bats-for-discipline-and-dedication/articleshow/136054187.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:57:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136054212,imgsize-173396.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In bizarre mix-up, Asaduddin Owaisi accorded guard of honour meant for Supreme Court judge in Uttar Pradesh]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-bizarre-mix-up-asaduddin-owaisi-accorded-guard-of-honour-meant-for-supreme-court-judge-in-uttar-pradesh/articleshow/136053568.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136053568.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-bizarre-mix-up-asaduddin-owaisi-accorded-guard-of-honour-meant-for-supreme-court-judge-in-uttar-pradesh/articleshow/136053568.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-bizarre-mix-up-asaduddin-owaisi-accorded-guard-of-honour-meant-for-supreme-court-judge-in-uttar-pradesh/articleshow/136053568.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:52:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136054092,imgsize-64660.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bihar 'alliance' redux in UP: Congress, SP play numbers game; can Priyanka do it for Rahul again?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-alliance-redux-in-up-congress-sp-play-numbers-game-can-priyanka-do-it-for-rahul-again/articleshow/136025450.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136025450.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav and Rahul Gandhi are negotiating a seat-sharing arrangement for the upcoming Uttar Pradesh assembly elections. The Samajwadi Party and Congress, both part of the INDIA alliance, are facing tensions over seat allocations. Previous experiences in Bihar are influencing their current discussions as both parties seek to avoid a repeat of past mistakes. Congress has shown willingness to compromise while maintaining its demands.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-alliance-redux-in-up-congress-sp-play-numbers-game-can-priyanka-do-it-for-rahul-again/articleshow/136025450.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-alliance-redux-in-up-congress-sp-play-numbers-game-can-priyanka-do-it-for-rahul-again/articleshow/136025450.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:42:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136053962,imgsize-105920.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Google commits $5 million to IIT-Kharagpur for AI research, talent development]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/google-commits-5-million-to-iit-kharagpur-for-ai-research-talent-development/articleshow/136053247.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136053247.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Google has committed $5 million to IIT-Kharagpur to advance artificial intelligence research and education. This initiative will focus on various fields including Indic languages, agriculture, and educational technology. The funding aims to improve the institute's AI infrastructure and expand training for students and educators. The partnership coincides with IIT-Kharagpur's 75th anniversary, emphasizing Google's support for Indian innovation. This initiative aligns with the Indian government's efforts to develop homegrown AI capabilities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/google-commits-5-million-to-iit-kharagpur-for-ai-research-talent-development/articleshow/136053247.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/google-commits-5-million-to-iit-kharagpur-for-ai-research-talent-development/articleshow/136053247.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:41:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Manash Pratim Gohain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136053823,imgsize-1153656.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Will write to EC': Akhilesh alleges UP officials working as 'BJP functionaries' ahead of polls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-write-to-ec-akhilesh-alleges-up-officials-working-as-bjp-functionaries-ahead-of-polls/articleshow/136053192.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136053192.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-write-to-ec-akhilesh-alleges-up-officials-working-as-bjp-functionaries-ahead-of-polls/articleshow/136053192.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-write-to-ec-akhilesh-alleges-up-officials-working-as-bjp-functionaries-ahead-of-polls/articleshow/136053192.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:15:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136053213,imgsize-118790.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Turns a blind eye': BJP takes swipe at Rahul Gandhi as Trump hails India's 7% GDP growth]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/turns-a-blind-eye-bjp-takes-swipe-at-rahul-gandhi-as-trump-hails-indias-7-gdp-growth/articleshow/136051775.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136051775.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a recent statement, Donald Trump praised India's impressive 7% GDP growth while taking the Federal Reserve to task for its high interest rates. He opined that reducing these rates could spur US economic growth by 15 to 20 percent. Trump's advocacy for a stronger economy aligns with BJP leader Ashish Sood's approval of India's fiscal achievements, contrasting his earlier critiques of Indian trade policies from July 2025.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/turns-a-blind-eye-bjp-takes-swipe-at-rahul-gandhi-as-trump-hails-indias-7-gdp-growth/articleshow/136051775.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/turns-a-blind-eye-bjp-takes-swipe-at-rahul-gandhi-as-trump-hails-indias-7-gdp-growth/articleshow/136051775.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:07:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136053709,imgsize-81962.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Thank you Singh Sb’: Sonia Gandhi acknowledges Sikh man's effort to preserve her childhood home]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-you-singh-sb-sonia-gandhi-acknowledges-sikh-mans-effort-to-preserve-her-childhood-home/articleshow/136052862.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136052862.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Acquiring Sonia Gandhi's old home in Italy, Sukhdev Singh Kang aspires to establish a museum in her honor. He received public acknowledgment from Sonia Gandhi on social media, expressing his gratitude. The post sparked varied responses, blending admiration with light political humor, and highlighted the Sikh community's fondness for her. Kang considers her recognition of his efforts deeply meaningful and transformative.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-you-singh-sb-sonia-gandhi-acknowledges-sikh-mans-effort-to-preserve-her-childhood-home/articleshow/136052862.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/thank-you-singh-sb-sonia-gandhi-acknowledges-sikh-mans-effort-to-preserve-her-childhood-home/articleshow/136052862.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T17:05:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yudhvir Rana</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052900,imgsize-1863516.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Third contender has arrived': Owaisi says new UP alliance has unsettled Yogi, Akhilesh]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/third-contender-has-arrived-owaisi-says-new-up-alliance-has-unsettled-yogi-akhilesh/articleshow/136052675.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136052675.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Asaduddin Owaisi expressed that the emergence of the 'Samajik Parivartan Morcha' has notably unsettled both Yogi Adityanath and Akhilesh Yadav. With a strategy to become a formidable alternative for the upcoming 2027 Uttar Pradesh assembly elections, Owaisi challenged the assertions of vote-splitting, highlighting the Samajwadi Party's mixed performance across different states.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/third-contender-has-arrived-owaisi-says-new-up-alliance-has-unsettled-yogi-akhilesh/articleshow/136052675.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/third-contender-has-arrived-owaisi-says-new-up-alliance-has-unsettled-yogi-akhilesh/articleshow/136052675.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T16:55:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052690,imgsize-56284.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Judgment will create confusion': TN consulting legal experts on SC ruling in Karthigai Deepam row]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/judgment-will-create-confusion-tn-consulting-legal-experts-on-sc-ruling-in-karthigai-deepam-row/articleshow/136052297.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136052297.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Tamil Nadu government is currently consulting legal experts about the Supreme Court's recent ruling. The judgment allows a one-time lighting of a lamp atop Thirupparankundram hill during Karthigai Deepam. Officials are deliberating on whether to comply with this ruling or challenge it legally. Social justice minister Vanni Arasu has expressed strong opposition to the judgment.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/judgment-will-create-confusion-tn-consulting-legal-experts-on-sc-ruling-in-karthigai-deepam-row/articleshow/136052297.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/judgment-will-create-confusion-tn-consulting-legal-experts-on-sc-ruling-in-karthigai-deepam-row/articleshow/136052297.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T16:44:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052404,imgsize-124839.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PM Modi launches projects worth Rs 34,000cr in Bihar; says state now known for development, not scams]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-launches-projects-worth-rs-34000cr-in-bihar-says-state-now-known-for-development-not-scams/articleshow/136052332.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136052332.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-launches-projects-worth-rs-34000cr-in-bihar-says-state-now-known-for-development-not-scams/articleshow/136052332.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-launches-projects-worth-rs-34000cr-in-bihar-says-state-now-known-for-development-not-scams/articleshow/136052332.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T16:41:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052354,imgsize-103946.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Prove you're alive with a selfie: What pensioners need to know about Jeevan Pramaan]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/prove-youre-alive-with-a-selfie-what-pensioners-need-to-know-about-jeevan-pramaan/articleshow/136051730.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136051730.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Digital Life Certificate system in India provides a hassle-free way for pensioners to verify their identities annually through a simple selfie. Utilizing Aadhaar authentication via the Jeevan Pramaan and UIDAI’s AadhaarFaceRD apps, this initiative especially helps elderly and physically challenged individuals avoid travel difficulties. As part of a broader campaign to promote this service among pensioners, they must verify their information's accuracy before submission.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/prove-youre-alive-with-a-selfie-what-pensioners-need-to-know-about-jeevan-pramaan/articleshow/136051730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/prove-youre-alive-with-a-selfie-what-pensioners-need-to-know-about-jeevan-pramaan/articleshow/136051730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T16:31:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136052101,imgsize-166850.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['First violence, now poisonous liquor': Rahul Gandhi accuses Manipur BJP govt of negligence over spurious alcohol deaths]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/first-violence-now-poisonous-liquor-rahul-gandhi-accuses-manipur-bjp-govt-of-negligence-over-spurious-alcohol-deaths/articleshow/136051110.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/first-violence-now-poisonous-liquor-rahul-gandhi-accuses-manipur-bjp-govt-of-negligence-over-spurious-alcohol-deaths/articleshow/136051110.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T16:13:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136051691,imgsize-105162.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[HC pulls up UP govt over registration of FIRs under law declared 'stillborn' by SC]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/hc-pulls-up-up-govt-over-registration-of-firs-under-law-declared-stillborn-by-sc/articleshow/136051179.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;"