rt/articleshow/136050607.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136050607.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A US congressional commission has warned that China's growing military support for Pakistan could heighten the risk of a two-front conflict for India. In its report, it urged Washington to deepen defence cooperation with New Delhi, particularly in the Indian Ocean, including intelligence sharing and joint tracking of Chinese naval and submarine movements. It also flagged Beijing's expanding strategic presence in the region.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/china-pakistan-ties-raise-two-front-conflict-risk-for-india-us-report/articleshow/136050607.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/china-pakistan-ties-raise-two-front-conflict-risk-for-india-us-report/articleshow/136050607.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-21T15:24:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136050744,imgsize-915083.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Nitish conceived the project': Prashant Kishor's rare praise for former Bihar CM with a jibe at BJP, RJD]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nitish-conceived-the-project-prashant-kishors-rare-praise-for-former-bihar-cm-with-a-jibe-at-bjp-rjd/articleshow/136050479.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136050479.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nitish-conceived-the-project-prashant-kishors-rare-praise-for-former-bihar-cm-with-a-jibe-at-bjp-rjd/articleshow/136050479.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nitish-conceived-